ed_by":null},{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-07-08T21:59:54Z","updated_at":"2026-07-09T16:28:43Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.7.stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 3 monitors - Direct3D 12 (Mobile) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1080 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8180) - AMD Ryzen 5 7600 6-Core Processor (12 threads) - 31.11 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nLet's say you have a DrawableTexture2D and draw to it in the editor (e.g. using tool scripts). You then try to get the resulting Image, so you can save it. The returned Image does not contain any of the drawn textures. The expected behavior is that the Image should have all of the textures that were drawn onto the DrawableTexture.\n\nWhen running the project, the expected behavior seems to work. It only does not work in the editor.\n\nBehavior:\n<img width=\"890\" height=\"477\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/98f3ebc4-b082-4af1-a91e-5c10f12c8073\" />\n\nExpected:\n<img width=\"890\" height=\"477\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bc936635-f373-4d61-bfb9-6417d6bbe0dc\" />\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Open MRP\n- Open the test scene\n- Notice how the 'Copy' node does not properly copy the texture of the 'Drawable' node\n- Run the project and notice how 'Copy' now properly copies 'Drawable'.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[drawable_mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29819302/drawable_mrp.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121113/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121113/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}